ZTNA SERVER COMMAND REFERENCE

HELP COMMANDS

help 			-Use: Displays the main available command categories.
show ?	 		-Use: Displays all available show commands.

config ?		-Use: Displays all available configuration commands.

config add ?		-Use: Displays commands available for adding configuration.

config approve ?	-Use: Displays the command format for device approval.

config reject ?		-Use: Displays the command format for device rejection.

config intergration ?	-Use: Displays the available integration types.

report ?		-Use: Displays the available report commands.

SHOW COMMANDS



show current-rule	-Use: Displays the current ZTNA security rules, including allowed operating systems and blacklisted applications.

show active-device	-Use: Displays all registered devices that are currently online.

show all-device		-Use: Displays all registered devices with their system name, UID, OS, registration status, IP address, device status and username.

show pending-device	-Use: Displays devices that are currently waiting for registration approval.

show all-users		-Use: Displays all local users and external LDAP users along with their assigned groups and user type.

show intergration	-Use: Displays all configured network device and user database integrations.


CONFIGURATION COMMANDS


config add os		-Use: Adds an operating system and its minimum allowed version to the allowed OS list.

config add local-user	-Use: Adds a local user and assigns the user to a configured group.

config add group	-Use: Creates a new user group and assigns permitted network devices to the group.

config add blacklist-app -Use: Adds an application to the blacklist.


DEVICE MANAGEMENT COMMANDS


config approve		-Use: Approves a pending device using its Device UID.

config reject		-Use: Rejects a device using its Device UID.


INTEGRATION COMMANDS


config intergration FortiGate 	-Use: Adds a FortiGate firewall integration using the firewall IP/hostname, management port and API token.

config intergration Aruba-CXOS	-Use: Adds an Aruba CX switch integration using the switch IP/hostname, SSH username and SSH password.

config intergration LDAP	-Use: Adds an LDAP server integration for external user authentication and group information.

# REPORT COMMANDS

report device-report		-Use: Displays the detailed endpoint report for a specified Device UID.The report displays User and Host Details , Operating ,System Details, Antivirus Details, Application Details

